    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Aurora Innovation, Inc. is a public company headquartered in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, traded under the ticker AUR and registered with the SEC under CIK 0001828108. Its website describes self-driving freight powered by the Aurora Driver, which the company says combines hardware and software backed by verifiable AI and integrates into customer fleets. The site frames the technology as delivering safety and efficiency benefits, and quotes partners on pilot programs, including autonomous hauling between Fort Worth and El Paso and integration into the Volvo VNL Autonomous.\n\nThe site's quoted material includes claims about autonomous miles driven and projected growth in freight volumes, presented as customer and partner statements rather than company figures. No AI products are tracked in the held record beyond the Aurora Driver as described on the site, and no MCP servers are listed.\n\nThe held facts record no lawsuits involving the company. The only litigation-related field associates it with Pennsylvania, which has 178 entries in that record.",
